      "value": "The more I think about giving players access to new beta features early, before they are released, is very reasonable and something that would make sense to use a subscription system for. It's like youtubers letting patreon subs see videos early. (This is just an idea and like I said, coming to me for ideas like this is probably a bad plan.)",
